The Award Registration Agent ensures that every settlement agreement or adjudicated award is duly registered, recorded, and disseminated across required regulatory and institutional systems. It facilitates electronic submission of awards to NCLT, IBBI, or other statutory repositories, maintaining traceability and legal enforceability.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:5:"title";N;s:11:"last_change";a:4:{s:4:"date";N;s:4:"user";N;s:2:"ip";N;s:3:"sum";N;}}s:10:"persistent";a:3:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761649428;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";}}